{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rules of Nature Demo</i> is an open-world post-apocalyptic survival game. In a zombie apocalypse, as one of the few survivors, you must scavenge towns for supplies, stay vigilant against zombie attacks, recruit survivors, and build your base. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of lootable items: medical supplies, food, drinks, weapons, building materials, seeds, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat system: unarmed attacks, melee weapons, executions, parrying with defensive weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firearms: pistols, SMGs, rifles, shotguns, sniper rifles, suppressors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buildings: foundations, workbenches, warehouses, generators, wind/solar power, rainwater collectors, survivor camps, medical centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit survivors to gather resources, explore, and fight hordes. Build your base. Survival is your duty!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762320?t=1748621344","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762320/2bd9c391038784435b97bf14ef478e17de11c138/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748621344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762320/96e1fa2cb10df573aaa811ef997c50c21e949834/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748621344","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762320/96e1fa2cb10df573aaa811ef997c50c21e949834/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748621344","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all ages or inappropriate to access during work: frequent violence or gore, revealing clothing, and common adult themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rules of Nature Demo</i> is an open-world post-apocalyptic survival game. In a zombie apocalypse, as one of the few survivors, you must scavenge towns for supplies, stay vigilant against zombie attacks, recruit survivors, and build your base. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of lootable items: medical supplies, food, drinks, weapons, building materials, seeds, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat system: unarmed attacks, melee weapons, executions, parrying with defensive weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firearms: pistols, SMGs, rifles, shotguns, sniper rifles, suppressors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buildings: foundations, workbenches, warehouses, generators, wind/solar power, rainwater collectors, survivor camps, medical centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit survivors to gather resources, explore, and fight hordes. Build your base. Survival is your duty!</p>","developers":["BombGame"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3759510","name":"Rules of Nature"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762320/a3f9e71eb97bd6a97df8e48d5cfff2a5a8a346bc/header.jpg?t=1748621344","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148329,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148329/movie480.mp4?t=1748612620","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148329/movie_max.mp4?t=1748612620"},"name":"PV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148329/676ec83bec21c030f666b4710bc3fa9cfc188a74/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748612620","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148329/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748612620","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148329/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748612620"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257143149,"mp4":{"480":"http://